Moves the legacy SkShaper factories out of SkShaper.cpp into SkShaper_legacy.cpp.

SkShaper::Make, PurgeCaches, MakeBiDiRunIterator and MakeScriptRunIterator
reference SkShapers::HB and SkUnicode when HarfBuzz and SkUnicode are enabled.
They share SkShaper.cpp with MakeFontMgrRunIterator and
MakeStdLanguageRunIterator, which modules/svg calls. Pulling that one object
file therefore pulled HarfBuzz and SkUnicode into every SVG consumer. After the
move an SVG-only consumer links svg + skshaper + skresources without them.

The code is unchanged. SK_DISABLE_LEGACY_SKSHAPER_FUNCTIONS is not used for
this because it also removes pure virtual SkShaper::shape overloads, which
changes the vtable that consumers compile against.

